@@ -33,3 +33,14 @@ node src/cli.js summary --file <path> --month <YYYY-MM>
 Prints `<category>\t<count>\t<amount_cents>` for each category with entries in the
 month, sorted by category, then `TOTAL\t<count>\t<amount_cents>`. A month without
 entries prints only `TOTAL\t0\t0`. `--month` must be a real month such as `2026-01`.
+
+## budget
+
+```sh
+node src/cli.js budget --file <path> --budgets <path> --month <YYYY-MM>
+```
+
+`--budgets` is a JSON object of category to monthly budget in cents. Prints
+`<category>\t<spent>\t<budget>\t<remaining>\t<status>` for every category with a budget or
+spending in the month, sorted by category. Status is `OK`, `OVER`, or `NO_BUDGET` (budget and
+remaining are then `-`). Exits with 2 when any category is `OVER`, otherwise 0.
